# Caddy

**Authority:** [Caddyfile syntax](https://caddyserver.com/docs/caddyfile) and directive pages linked from it.

| Topic | Official doc |
|-------|----------------|
| Reverse proxy | [reverse_proxy](https://caddyserver.com/docs/caddyfile/directives/reverse_proxy) |
| Snippets / reuse | [import](https://caddyserver.com/docs/caddyfile/directives/import) |
